      "title": "Career Design Center",
      "description": "Career Design Center - SUNY Geneseo Skip to content Search this site About About Facts Campus Map Awards & Rankings Diversity News Center Directory Meet Our Faculty Academics Academics Schools and Departments Majors, Minors, and Academic Programs Research Study Abroad Career Design Center Library Admissions Office of Admissions Visit and Connect Apply First Year Transfer Graduate International Tuition And Aid Campus Life Campus Life Clubs and Organizations Events Calendar Residential Communities Dining & Catering Info For Future Students Current Students Faculty And Staff Alumni Parents and Families Community Members Athletics Give Apply Apply Search this site Apply Apply Career Design Center About Us/ Staff Connect With a Career Coach Handshake Guidance Events & Workshops Online Resources For Students Resources for Education Majors For Alumni Internships and Applied Learning Internship Information Internship and Living Stipend Program Student Teacher Living Stipend Program Individualized Integrative and Applied Learning (IAL) Opportunities For Faculty & Staff For Families & Supporters For Employers Outcomes Career Ready Fellows About About Facts Campus Map Awards & Rankings Diversity News Center Directory Meet Our Faculty Academics Academics Schools and Departments Majors, Minors, and Academic Programs Research Study Abroad Career Design Center Library Admissions Office of Admissions Visit and Connect Apply First Year Transfer Graduate International Tuition And Aid Campus Life Campus Life Clubs and Organizations Events Calendar Residential Communities Dining & Catering Info For Future Students Current Students Faculty And Staff Alumni Parents and Families Community Members Athletics Give Home Career Design Center Career Design Center About Us/ Staff Connect With a Career Coach Handshake Guidance Events & Workshops Online Resources For Students Resources for Education Majors For Alumni Internships and Applied Learning Internship Information Internship and Living Stipend Program Student Teacher Living Stipend Program Individualized Integrative and Applied Learning (IAL) Opportunities For Faculty & Staff For Families & Supporters For Employers Outcomes Career Ready Fellows Career Design Center The Career Design Center encourages students to be active participants in their future by engaging their curiosities, trying things out, making adjustments, and embracing change, even when they might not be able to imagine their future career goals. Career design is not about students figuring out what they want to do for the rest of their lives; it is about whatever they want to do next. Read more about the Career Design Center . CONNECT WITH A CAREER COACH EVENTS & WORKSHOPS INTERNSHIP SEARCH RESOURCES CAREER MILESTONES Looking for a Job or Internship? Embarking on the journey to find a job or internship can be both exciting and challenging. Our comprehensive resources, including Handshake—a platform connecting you with employers and opportunities—are tailored to help you navigate your career path. Additionally, our team offers personalized guidance to align your strengths and interests with potential career options. Take advantage of the resources we’ve curated to assist you in achieving your professional goals. JOB AND INTERNSHIP SEARCH RESOURCES The Career Design Center’s Commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Belonging Diversity, equity, and belonging are at the center of our work. We are committed to ensuring equitable access to career preparation by addressing equity gaps that can improve career mobility and positive outcomes. 100% of our staff members have completed Safe Zone and Mental Health First Aid Training, as well as the Advancing Cultural Competency Certificate (ACCC) Program. We strive to create a safe and supportive space that is welcoming to everyone and celebrates our differences. We also recognize that our DEB work is never complete and will focus on the continuous improvement to better support our students and campus community. We appreciate you and you are welcome here! Quick Links New Iris Headshot Photobooth Students/Alumni Internship Information Register An Internship Resume Resources Job Search Graduate School Job & Internship Search Resources Employers Handshake Guidelines Employer FAQ Related Resources Student Employment Services Volunteer Academic Calendar Contact Email: careers@geneseo.edu Phone: (585) 245-5721 Office Hours: Monday – Friday – 8:00 AM – 4:15 PM SUNY Geneseo loves hearing from you via social media and we welcome and encourage open, thoughtful discussion. We apply SUNY Geneseo’s Comment Guidelines to help our readers share their thoughts in safe and engaging digital spaces. You can find those guidelines here. Mailing Address SUNY Geneseo 116 Erwin Hall, 1 College Circle Geneseo, NY 14454 Related Pages Connect With a Career Coach Quick Links Contact Geneseo Campus Map Directory Emergency Info Quick Links Contact Geneseo Campus Map Directory Emergency Info Join Us Apply to Geneseo Transfer to Geneseo Alumni Community Work at Geneseo Join Us Apply to Geneseo Transfer to Geneseo Alumni Community Work at Geneseo Policies Title IX Policy and Reporting Form Anti-Hazing Policy and Reporting Form Policies Title IX Policy and Reporting Form Anti-Hazing Policy and Reporting Form Website Info Accessibility Privacy Student Right to Know Web Editor Login Website Info Accessibility Privacy Student Right to Know Web Editor Login Copyright © 2026 SUNY Geneseo Facebook Instagram LinkedIn Bluesky YouTube Scroll to Top"
